39
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.400
Ah, Pumbaa, look
at that little guy!

40
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.700
A chip off the old block!

41
00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.900
And ya gotta know
who's gonna raise him.

42
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.000
- His parents?
- Okay, sure. Get technical.

43
00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.100
But who's gonna teach him
the really important stuff?

44
00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.500
Like how to belch.
[ Belches ]

45
00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:13.400
And dig for grubs.

46
00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:17.100
I'm tellin' ya, buddy,
it's gonna be like old times--

47
00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.600
You, me, and the little guy.

48
00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:23.800
- [ Chuckling ] It is a girl.
- Girl.

49
00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.900
- Girl? Oy.
- Girl? Oh.

50
00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.700
Wow!

51
00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:48.500
- [ Grunts ]
- Whoa.

52
00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.500
- [ Laughing ]
- Where do you think
you're going in such a hurry?

53
00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:58.300
[ Giggling ]
Daddy! Let go.

54
00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.500
Well, I just want you
to be careful.

55
00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:03.200
[ Childish Growling ]

56
00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:07.100
Kiara, are you listening?
Accidents can happen.

57
00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:13.000
- You could easily get hurt--
- " Hurt, or stepped on,
or even get lost."

58
00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:15.200
[ Sighs ]
And remember--

59
00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.700
- I want you to stay in sight
of Pride Rock at all times.
- "...at all times."

60
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:21.800
I know. "And if I see any strangers,
don't talk to them.

61
00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:26.100
Come straight home."
Okay, okay. Can I go now?

62
00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.200
- Please?
- Mm-hmm.

63
00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:32.300
- Very funny.
- [ Laughs ] Mind your father, Kiara.

64
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:36.200
- [ Giggles ] Yes, Mom.
- And stay away from the outlands.

65
00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:41.200
Nothing there but a bunch
of backstabbing, murderous outsiders.

66
00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:44.900
Zazu's right.
You can't turn your back on them.

67
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.200
Really?
How come?

68
00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:51.000
[ Sighs ]
Never mind. Just run along now.

69
00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:54.700
- But, Dad, I--
- You'll understand someday. Go on.

70
00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:58.000
- Dad!
- [ Purring ]

71
00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:04.700
{y:i}And stay on the path
{y:i}I've marked for you.

72
00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:09.100
[ Chuckles ]
Simba. Who does she remind you of, hmm?

73
00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.800
Huh? What? Who?

74
00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:15.600
She's just like you were
when you were young.

75
00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:19.500
Exactly! Do you realize
the dangers we put ourselves in?

76
00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:22.700
- Uh!
- You mean the dangers you put us in.

77
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.800
[ Chuckling ]

78
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.900
Hmm.

79
00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.600
[ Laughs ]
She'll be fine.

80
00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.000
[ Whispering ]
Hey, Timon! Pumbaa! Come here.

81
00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.300
[ Timon ]
Good morning, mon capitaine!

82
00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.700
I want you to keep
a close watch on Kiara.

83
00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.200
You know she's
bound to run off.

84
00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.100
Don't worry, Simba,
we're on her like stink on a warthog.

85
00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.600
- Hey!
- It's a hard truth, Pumbaa.
Live with it.

86
00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.900
Guys, I'm counting on you.

87
00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:57.400
Danger could be lurking
behind every rock.

88
00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.800
- Aha!
- Hm! Hm! Hmm.

89
00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:05.600
[ Growling ]

90
00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.800
Hey! Wait! Come back.

91
00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:12.200
[ Feeble Growling ]
I just want to play.

92
00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.200
[ Panting ]

93
00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.300
[ Sighing ]

94
00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.300
The mighty hunter...

95
00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:21.300
{y:i}has cornered her prey.

96
00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:25.000
[ Childish Growling, Roaring ]

97
00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.900
Huh?

98
00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:34.000
Whoa! Cool.

99
00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.100
The outlands.

100
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.800
I wonder what's out there.

101
00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.900
{y:i}[Rustling Grass]

102
00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:50.600
{y:i}[Twig Snapping]

103
00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:53.300
- [ Screaming ]
- [ Screaming ]

104
00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.600
- [ Screaming ]
- [ Splashing ]

105
00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:04.000
Oh, don't worry, Kiara.
Uncle Pumbaa's comin'.

106
00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:07.300
Oh, no! Oh! Uh, uh--

107
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:11.600
Let's see. "Gee, Simba, the good news
is we found your daughter.

108
00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.200
The bad news is we dropped
a warthog on her.

109
00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:16.200
is there a problem with that?"

110
00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:18.600
- [ Gurgling ]
- Kiara? Kiara?

111
00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.600
Pumbaa!
Let me define " baby-sitting."

112
00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.600
[ Coughing, Choking ]

113
00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.900
[ Spitting ]

114
00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:30.000
Sorry.

115
00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.700
Now, Princess Kiara,
as Simba's daughter,

116
00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:36.500
you know better than
to go off all alone.

117
00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.900
- You could have been hurt.
- Bu-But--

118
00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:42.200
Hurt? Oh, Simba would kill us!

119
00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.300
- You didn't slip a disk, did ya?
- Bu-Bu--

120
00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.800
- Catch a fever? Get a hangnail?
- Aah! Timon--

121
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.900
- I had one once.
- Very painful.

122
00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:52.100
{y:i}Excruciating.

123
00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:55.100
Darling, with your complexion,
you should stay out of the sun.

124
00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.400
What? Do you wanna wrinkle?

125
00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.900
Will somebody please
Just listen to me?

126
00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:04.200
I'm sorry, I wasn't listening.
Did you say something, Princess?

127
00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:08.700
I'm not just a princess, you know.
That's only half of who I am.

128
00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:13.900
- Oh, uh, who's the other half?
- Oh, well, I, uh, um--

129
00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.800
Well, while you're
figuring it out,

130
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.200
let's eat!

131
00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:22.000
[ Snaps Fingers ]
Here we are! Grubs.

132
00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:24.700
The other white meat.

133
00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:29.000
- And so high in protein.
- Eww! Gross!

134
00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:32.200
No? How 'bout you, big boy?

135
00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:37.300
- [ Sniffing ] Ah! Love grubs.
- Not " like."

136
00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:39.400
- Love!
- Love!

137
00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:42.200
[ Crunches, Hiccups, Spits Out ]

138
00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:44.500
Oh! You always do that.

139
00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:48.300
You take a bite out of every one, and
then put it back. It drives me crazy.

140
00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:53.100
But you can't tell from the outside
which are the real slimy ones.

141
00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:56.600
Slimy? Pumbaa,
my corpulent compadre,

142
00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.800
{y:i}it's the crunchy ones
{y:i}that make the meal.

143
00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:01.400
{y:i}- Slimy.
- Crunchy.

144
00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:05.000
- Slimy! Slimy! Slimy!
- Crunchy! Crunchy! Crunchy!

145
00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.900
- Slimy! Slimy! Less filling.
- Crunchy! Crunchy! Tastes good.

146
00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.300
- Less filling. Less filling.
- Tastes good. Tastes good.

147
00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.400
[ Arguing Continues ]

148
00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.300
[ Laughing ]

149
00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.000
[ Grunting ]

150
00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.700
[ Snarling ]

151
00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:37.400
Who are you, pride lander?

152
00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:39.700
- [ Panting ]
- [ Snarling ]

153
00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:48.200
- What are you doing?
- My father says to never turn
your back on an outsider.

154
00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:51.100
- You always do what Daddy says?
- No!

155
00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:55.100
Bet ya do! Bet you're
Daddy's little girl. [ Scoffs ]

156
00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.500
An outsider
doesn't need anybody.

157
00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.000
I take care of myself.

158
00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.700
- Really?
- [ Growling ]

159
00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:07.600
- Cool!
{y:i}- [Water Splashing]

160
00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.500
{y:i}[Screaming]

161
00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:12.100
- [ Both Screaming ]
{y:i}- [Kiara] Run!

162
00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.500
This way!

163
00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:22.200
[ Both Gasping ]

164
00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:27.100
- [ Laughing ] That was a close one.
- [ Sighing ]

165
00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:29.200
[ Laughing ]
Yeah.

166
00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:31.800
- [ Growling ]
- [ Lions Screaming ]

167
00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.900
{y:i}Scoot!

168
00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:39.000
- Whoa!
- Hey, wh-what about me?

169
00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:42.700
I-I'll distract him!
Run! Whoops!

170
00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.700
Whoop-- Oh!

171
00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.900
[ Choking ]

172
00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:53.900
- [ Screaming ]
- [ Crocodile Growling ]

173
00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.200
- Look out!
- [ Whimpering ]

174
00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:00.300
{y:i}- [Screaming]
- [ Grunting ] Move it!

175
00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.500
[ Laughing ]
Whoa!

176
00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.600
[ Grunting ]

177
00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:12.400
[ Both Gasping ]

178
00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.500
{y:i}[Roaring]

179
00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.800
[ All Roaring ]

180
00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:22.900
I did it! I did it!
[ Blows Raspberry ]

181
00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.900
- [ Laughing ]
- Ha! [ Laughing ]

182
00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:29.400
Ho, man, did you see
the size of those teeth?

183
00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:32.000
They were going,
" Rr, rr, rr, rr."

184
00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:35.400
[ Laughing ]
He just totally ate me up right there,

185
00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:38.500
and I jumped on his head,
and I popped him so good!

186
00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:40.900
We make such a good team!

187
00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:45.200
And you--
You were really brave.

188
00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:48.600
Yeah? You were pretty brave too.

189
00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:51.900
- My name's Kovu.
- [ Giggles ] I'm Kiara.

190
00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:54.600
[ Growling ]

191
00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:58.300
[ Giggling ]
Tag! You're it!

192
00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:03.400
Tag! You're it! You're it!
[ Laughing ]

193
00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:12.000
Hello? You run, I tag.
Get it?

194
00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.300
What's the matter?
Don't you know how to play?

195
00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:18.900
Oh.
[ Growls Playfully ]

196
00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.800
{y:i}- [Laughing]
- Ah. [ Growls ]

197
00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:24.500
{y:i}[Thunderous Roaring]

198
00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:28.400
[ Roaring ]

199
00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:31.000
- Zira.
- Simba.

200
00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:34.500
{y:i}[Others Growling]

201
00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.900
- Nala.
- Zira.

202
00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:43.100
Timon, Pumbaa. Great!
Now that we all know each other,

203
00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:47.600
- Get out of our pride lands!
{y:i}- Your pride lands?

204
00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.200
- [ Roaring ]
- [ Panicked Laughing ]

205
00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:54.700
These lands belong to Scar.

206
00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.300
I banished you
from the pride lands.

207
00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.000
Now, you and your
young cub, get out!

208
00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:06.000
Oh, haven't you met
my son, Kovu?

209
00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:11.700
He was hand-chosen by Scar
to follow in his paw prints,

210
00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:14.900
and become king.

211
00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:18.600
- [ Growling ]
- [ Whimpering ]

212
00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:22.400
Pfft! That's not a king.
That's a fuzzy maraca.

213
00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:25.000
Kovu was the last born...

214
00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:28.600
before you exiled us
to the outlands,

215
00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:33.200
where we have little food,
less water.

216
00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:36.500
You know the penalty
for returning to the pride lands.

217
00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:39.000
But the child does not!

218
00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:44.300
However, if you need
your pound of flesh, here.

219
00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:47.500
[ Whimpering ]

220
00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.700
Take him and get out.

221
00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:54.100
We're finished here.

222
00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.900
- [ Kiara ] Oh!
- [ Zira ] Oh, no, Simba.

223
00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:04.000
We have barely begun.
[ Chuckling ]

224
00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:10.700
[ Gasps ]

225
00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.600
[ Whispering ]
Bye.

226
00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:18.300
[ Whispering ]
Bye.

227
00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:32.200
- Simba?
- [ Clears Throat ]

228
00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.800
[ Giggles ]

229
00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:47.100
- [ Sighs ]
- Kiara, what did you think
you were doing?

230
00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.100
You could have
been killed today.

231
00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.600
But, Daddy, I-I didn't
