00:31:06.700 --> 00:31:08.700
[ Panting ]

470
00:31:13.600 --> 00:31:16.200
[ Nuka ]
Let's light fires!

471
00:31:16.400 --> 00:31:18.700
[ Chuckling ]

472
00:31:18.900 --> 00:31:21.800
[ Yelling, Laughing ]

473
00:31:22.000 --> 00:31:26.300
* Roasty-toasty princess
roasty-toasty princess * *

474
00:31:26.600 --> 00:31:29.700
Hey, is it hot in here,
or is that just me?

475
00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:32.800
Fire!
[ Screaming ]

476
00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:36.100
- [ Laughing ]
- Come on.

477
00:31:45.100 --> 00:31:47.900
Wha--

478
00:31:54.300 --> 00:31:56.100
[ Gasps ]

479
00:32:04.300 --> 00:32:07.900
The plan is in motion. Go!

480
00:32:13.800 --> 00:32:17.200
Don't worry, Simba.
She'll be fine!

481
00:32:17.400 --> 00:32:19.400
{y:i}What could happen?

482
00:32:19.500 --> 00:32:22.700
[ Gasps ]
No! No! Kiara!

483
00:32:22.900 --> 00:32:26.600
- [ Gasps ]
- Zazu! Fly ahead! Find her!

484
00:32:26.900 --> 00:32:29.400
- [ Growling ]
- [ Frightened Neighing ]

485
00:32:31.400 --> 00:32:34.600
[ Panting ]
Oh!

486
00:32:34.800 --> 00:32:36.700
[ Screams ]

487
00:32:38.000 --> 00:32:39.800
[ Coughing ]

488
00:32:46.000 --> 00:32:48.200
No!

489
00:32:51.400 --> 00:32:53.800
[ Panting, Grunting ]

490
00:32:56.200 --> 00:32:58.700
[ Grunting, Sighing ]

491
00:33:04.300 --> 00:33:07.600
- [ Deep Growling ]
- [ Moaning ]

492
00:33:11.100 --> 00:33:12.900
[ Growling ]

493
00:33:13.100 --> 00:33:14.900
[ Sighing ]

494
00:33:22.900 --> 00:33:24.700
[ Snarling ]

495
00:33:46.200 --> 00:33:48.400
[ Kovu Grunting ]

496
00:33:50.500 --> 00:33:52.400
[ Gasps ]

497
00:33:58.300 --> 00:33:59.900
[ Gasps ]

498
00:34:01.500 --> 00:34:04.100
I must tell Simba!

499
00:34:09.400 --> 00:34:11.900
[ Coughing, Gasping ]

500
00:34:14.200 --> 00:34:18.800
- Where am I ?
- You're safe. I n the pride lands.

501
00:34:19.000 --> 00:34:22.000
The pride lands? No!

502
00:34:22.200 --> 00:34:24.600
Why'd you bring me here?
Who do you think you are?

503
00:34:24.800 --> 00:34:28.000
[ Gasps ] I think I'm the one
that just saved your life.

504
00:34:28.200 --> 00:34:30.600
Look, I had everything
under control.

505
00:34:30.700 --> 00:34:33.700
- Not from where I'm standing.
- Then move downwind.

506
00:34:33.900 --> 00:34:36.000
[ Growls ]

507
00:34:37.700 --> 00:34:40.300
[ Grunts, Sighs, Growls ]

508
00:34:44.100 --> 00:34:46.100
What are you doing?

509
00:34:47.200 --> 00:34:49.600
Kovu?

510
00:34:49.700 --> 00:34:52.900
{y:i}Kiara!
{y:i}[Snarling]

511
00:34:53.100 --> 00:34:55.200
Kiara, you're all right.

512
00:34:55.400 --> 00:34:57.200
Father, how could you
breakyour promise?

513
00:34:57.300 --> 00:34:59.600
It's a good thing I did.
I almost lost you.

514
00:34:59.700 --> 00:35:01.600
No more hunts for you.
Not ever.

515
00:35:01.700 --> 00:35:04.400
But I was doing just fine!
Even before Kovu--

516
00:35:04.600 --> 00:35:07.700
- Kovu?
{y:i}- [Both Snarling]

517
00:35:07.900 --> 00:35:10.100
- Simba!
- [ Growling ]

518
00:35:10.300 --> 00:35:12.200
{y:i}Hey! You!

519
00:35:12.400 --> 00:35:15.800
{y:i}How dare you save
{y:i}the king's daughter?

520
00:35:16.100 --> 00:35:18.700
You saved her? Why?

521
00:35:18.900 --> 00:35:22.100
- I humbly ask to join your pride.
- No!

522
00:35:22.400 --> 00:35:24.700
You were banished
with the other outsiders.

523
00:35:24.800 --> 00:35:27.800
I have left the outsiders.
I am a rogue.

524
00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:31.500
{y:i}Judge me now for who I am.
{y:i}[Sighing]

525
00:35:31.800 --> 00:35:36.100
Or am I to be blamed
for a crime I didn't commit?

526
00:35:36.300 --> 00:35:39.100
[ Growling ]

527
00:35:39.300 --> 00:35:42.100
{y:i}Simba, you owe him
{y:i}your daughter's life.

528
00:35:43.700 --> 00:35:46.400
Hmm, yes, sire.
Clearly we are in his debt.

529
00:35:46.600 --> 00:35:50.000
And royal protocol demands
that all debts be paid.

530
00:35:50.100 --> 00:35:52.800
Though in this case,
you might want to make an exception.

531
00:35:53.000 --> 00:35:55.200
Hmm.

532
00:35:58.000 --> 00:36:00.900
My father's law will prevail.

533
00:36:01.200 --> 00:36:03.900
For now, I reserve judgment.

534
00:36:04.000 --> 00:36:06.000
We'll see who you really are.

535
00:36:06.200 --> 00:36:08.200
Hmm.

536
00:36:09.500 --> 00:36:11.700
Hmph! Riffraff.

537
00:36:16.600 --> 00:36:18.400
[ Growling ]

538
00:36:29.300 --> 00:36:31.300
[ Gasps ]

539
00:36:33.000 --> 00:36:35.100
[ Growls ]

540
00:36:59.900 --> 00:37:03.800
Hey, uh, thanks
for saving me today.

541
00:37:04.000 --> 00:37:07.300
[ Laughs ] What kind of hunter
are you, anyway... Princess?

542
00:37:07.500 --> 00:37:09.700
You almost got yourself
killed out there.

543
00:37:09.900 --> 00:37:13.600
- What?
- You wouldn't last
three days on your own.

544
00:37:13.700 --> 00:37:16.900
Oh, and I suppose you
could teach me?

545
00:37:17.200 --> 00:37:19.200
[ Laughs ]
Oh. Yeah.

546
00:37:19.400 --> 00:37:22.100
{y:i}- [Simba] Kiara!
- Coming.

547
00:37:23.800 --> 00:37:26.800
All right! Impress me.

548
00:37:27.100 --> 00:37:29.400
We start at dawn.

549
00:37:31.200 --> 00:37:35.000
[ Chuckling ]
I look forward to it.

550
00:37:38.000 --> 00:37:42.000
[ Sputtering ]
Did you see that?

551
00:37:42.200 --> 00:37:45.300
- He let her go! If that were me, I--
- Hush.

552
00:37:45.500 --> 00:37:47.300
The fire rescue
worked perfectly,

553
00:37:47.500 --> 00:37:49.300
and Simba fell for it.

554
00:37:49.600 --> 00:37:52.600
Now, the closer Kovu
gets to the daughter,

555
00:37:52.800 --> 00:37:55.800
the closer he gets
to Simba!

556
00:37:57.700 --> 00:38:01.000
And once he has Simba alone--
[ Snarls ]

557
00:38:08.300 --> 00:38:10.200
[ Panting, Grunting ]

558
00:38:11.600 --> 00:38:15.000
{y:i}[Male Voice, Echoing]
{y:i}Simba! Simba!

559
00:38:15.200 --> 00:38:18.800
- Help me!
- Father!

560
00:38:19.100 --> 00:38:23.200
{y:i}[Evil Laughing, Echoing]

561
00:38:23.500 --> 00:38:26.400
No! Dad!

562
00:38:26.600 --> 00:38:29.100
Just a little farther.

563
00:38:31.300 --> 00:38:33.200
{y:i}- [Scar] Gotcha!
- [ Screams ]

564
00:38:33.300 --> 00:38:38.000
- Trust me.
{y:i}- Simba!

565
00:38:38.300 --> 00:38:40.600
No!

566
00:38:40.800 --> 00:38:44.500
- Scar.
- [ Laughing ]

567
00:38:46.600 --> 00:38:48.500
{y:i}- Kovu?
- Hyah!

568
00:38:48.600 --> 00:38:53.000
No!

569
00:38:53.300 --> 00:38:56.700
[ Panting, Gasping ]

570
00:39:31.800 --> 00:39:36.600
[ Growling ]

571
00:39:38.300 --> 00:39:40.400
Good morning.
[ Laughing ]

572
00:39:40.600 --> 00:39:44.500
I'm ready for my first lesson.
Surprised ya, huh?

573
00:39:46.200 --> 00:39:49.400
Hey, come on.
[ Laughing ] Let's go.

574
00:39:52.800 --> 00:39:54.700
[ Growling ]

575
00:39:59.300 --> 00:40:03.100
{y:i}- [Grass Rustling]
{y:i}- [Panting] Ow.

576
00:40:06.700 --> 00:40:08.600
{y:i}Ow! Ow.

577
00:40:08.700 --> 00:40:11.300
[ Sighing ]

578
00:40:11.500 --> 00:40:14.200
Three, two, one.

579
00:40:14.400 --> 00:40:17.200
Gotcha!

580
00:40:17.400 --> 00:40:19.800
You could hear me, huh?

581
00:40:20.000 --> 00:40:21.900
Only a lot.

582
00:40:23.700 --> 00:40:25.500
You're still breathing too hard.

583
00:40:25.700 --> 00:40:29.000
Relax. Feel the earth
under your paws,

584
00:40:29.200 --> 00:40:31.500
{y:i}so it doesn't shift
{y:i}and make noise.

585
00:40:31.700 --> 00:40:33.600
- [ Sighs ]
- [ Birds Calling ]

586
00:40:35.600 --> 00:40:40.000
Shh! Watch the master and learn.

587
00:40:44.300 --> 00:40:47.100
- [ Roaring ]
- [ Screaming ]

588
00:40:47.300 --> 00:40:49.200
Don't eat me, please.

589
00:40:49.200 --> 00:40:52.400
I-I-I never really met your tyrant--
I mean, uh, Scar. Scar.

590
00:40:52.700 --> 00:40:54.500
Oh, heck of a guy.
A little moody, but--

591
00:40:54.800 --> 00:40:57.800
Timon, what are
you doing here?

592
00:40:58.100 --> 00:41:00.300
Kiara! Thank goodness!

593
00:41:00.400 --> 00:41:03.200
Oh! Hey, for once,
we're not followin' ya.

594
00:41:03.400 --> 00:41:06.600
This just happens to be
the best smorgasbord in the pride lands.

595
00:41:06.900 --> 00:41:09.400
Bugs everywhere!

596
00:41:09.600 --> 00:41:12.400
But, you don't call
for a reservation, and-- Yeesh!

597
00:41:12.600 --> 00:41:15.300
Get outta here, ya scavengers.
Go on! Shoo!

598
00:41:15.400 --> 00:41:17.500
- Shoo! Ow!
- [ Swallowing ]

599
00:41:17.700 --> 00:41:21.100
[ Crying ]
Oh-ho-ho. Oh!

600
00:41:21.300 --> 00:41:24.000
[ Screaming Wildly ]

601
00:41:24.100 --> 00:41:27.100
[ Laughing, Screaming Wildly ]

602
00:41:27.300 --> 00:41:31.900
- [ Laughing ]
{y:i}- Oh, Timon! I'm gettin' tired.

603
00:41:32.100 --> 00:41:34.700
I gotta lose some pounds.

604
00:41:34.900 --> 00:41:36.900
Shoo! Go on!
Shoo! Shoo!

605
00:41:37.100 --> 00:41:39.600
- [ Laughing ]
- Hey, maybe he could help.

606
00:41:39.800 --> 00:41:41.600
- Do you think?
- Shoo!

607
00:41:41.800 --> 00:41:45.200
Oh, yeah, there's an idea.
Right. Let the vicious outsider--

608
00:41:45.400 --> 00:41:48.200
Hey! Wait!
I have an idea.

609
00:41:49.600 --> 00:41:51.800
- What if he helps?
- What?

610
00:41:52.000 --> 00:41:55.100
You want to lend
a voice? Hah?

611
00:41:55.200 --> 00:41:58.400
Grr. Gr--
Roar! Work with me!

612
00:41:58.700 --> 00:42:01.600
- Uh, huh?
- Like this. [ Roaring ]

613
00:42:01.800 --> 00:42:03.800
- [ Roaring Continues ]
- [ Birds Chirping ]

614
00:42:04.000 --> 00:42:06.900
Whoo-hoo! Come on.
Do it again. Do it again.

615
00:42:07.100 --> 00:42:10.400
- [ Louder Roaring ]
- [ Timon ] Yee-ha! [ Blows Raspberry ]

616
00:42:10.600 --> 00:42:13.900
Why are we doing this?
What's the point of this training?

617
00:42:14.000 --> 00:42:16.600
[ Laughing ]
Training? This is just for fun!

618
00:42:19.200 --> 00:42:21.100
- Fun?
- [ Laughing ]

619
00:42:21.300 --> 00:42:23.500
Yeesh, kid.
Ya gotta get out more often.

620
00:42:23.600 --> 00:42:25.900
Fun! Yee-ha!

621
00:42:26.100 --> 00:42:28.500
[ Laughing ]

622
00:42:28.600 --> 00:42:31.000
Woo-hoo! Yee-ha!

623
00:42:31.100 --> 00:42:33.000
- Yee-ha!
- [ Laughing ]

624
00:42:33.100 --> 00:42:34.800
- Yee-ha!
- [ Birds Twittering ]

625
00:42:36.900 --> 00:42:39.300
[ Timon ]
Whoa-oh-oh! [ Laughs ]

626
00:42:39.600 --> 00:42:41.900
- Yee-ha!
{y:i}- [Kiara] Yee- ha!

627
00:42:42.100 --> 00:42:44.400
[ All Laughing ]

628
00:42:44.500 --> 00:42:47.300
[ Screaming ]

629
00:42:47.500 --> 00:42:50.000
- Uh-oh.
- [ Blowing Raspberry ]

630
00:42:50.300 --> 00:42:52.900
- [ Bellowing ]
- Wow!

631
00:42:53.100 --> 00:42:54.900
[ All ]
Yee-ha!

632
00:42:59.500 --> 00:43:01.300
- Whoa!
- Whoa!

633
00:43:01.400 --> 00:43:03.200
[ Timon ]
Hey, rhino!

634
00:43:06.500 --> 00:43:10.500
[ Laughing ]

635
00:43:10.700 --> 00:43:14.000
- What a blast!
- Oh. Sorry.

636
00:43:14.300 --> 00:43:16.600
- [ Kovu, Kiara Laughing ]
- Aha! You're okay, kid.

637
00:43:16.800 --> 00:43:18.700
- Hey!
- You're okay.

638
00:43:18.900 --> 00:43:21.800
- Kid.
{y:i}- Excuse me. Pardon me. Pardon me.

639
00:43:22.000 --> 00:43:25.000
- [ Groaning ]
- That's it. That's it. That's it. Ooh--

640
00:43:25.100 --> 00:43:28.800
- A-Ahem. [ Laughing ]
- [ Laughing ]

641
00:43:29.100 --> 00:43:34.300
- Um-- S-Sorry. Uh--
- [ Stammering ]

642
00:43:34.500 --> 00:43:37.700
- [ Timon ] Hey, are you two
coming or what?
- [ Kiara Giggling ]

643
00:43:43.200 --> 00:43:45.800
{y:i}[Kovu] Did you see that?
{y:i}Did you see that? Watch.

644
00:43:46.000 --> 00:43:49.500
- Oh, wow. Look at that.
It's really pretty.
- What? Oh, yeah.

645
00:43:49.700 --> 00:43:52.900
You're right.
Oh, look!

646
00:43:53.200 --> 00:43:56.600
There's one that looks like
a baby rabbit. See the fluffy tail?

647
00:43:56.800 --> 00:43:59.200
Yeah. Hey!

648
00:43:59.400 --> 00:44:02.700
There's one that looks like two lions
killing each other for a scrap of meat.

649
00:44:02.900 --> 00:44:05.600
{y:i}[Laughs]
{y:i}Hey, I've never done this before.

650
00:44:05.700 --> 00:44:10.900
Really? My father and I
used to do this all the time.

651
00:44:11.200 --> 00:44:15.900
He says all the great kings
of the past are up there. [ Chuckles ]

652
00:44:16.200 --> 00:44:18.300
[ Whispering ]
Do ya think Scar's up there?

653
00:44:25.900 --> 00:44:29.500
He wasn't my father,
but he was still... part of me.

654
00:44:32.100 --> 00:44:34.800
My father said
there was a--

655
00:44:35.000 --> 00:44:39.300
a darkness in Scar
that he couldn't escape.

656
00:44:39.600 --> 00:44:44.300
Maybe there's
a darkness in me too.

657
00:44:44.600 --> 00:44:47.100
[ Purring ]

658
00:44:53.500 --> 00:44:58.500
Father, I am lost.
Kovu is one of them.

659
00:44:58.900 --> 00:45:01.200
Scar's heir.

660
00:45:01.200 --> 00:45:03.800
- How can I accept him?
{y:i}- Simba?

661
00:45:07.400 --> 00:45:10.300
I was seeking counsel
from the great kings.

662
00:45:10.500 --> 00:45:12.800
- Did they help?
- [ Sighs ]

663
00:45:13.000 --> 00:45:15.800
[ Simba ]
Silent as stars. My father would never--

664
00:45:16.100 --> 00:45:17.900
Oh, my Simba.

665
00:45:18.000 --> 00:45:21.200
You want so much
to walk the path expected of you.

666
00:45:21.500 --> 00:45:25.100
- Perhaps Kovu does not.
- What? How do you know--

667
00:45:25.200 --> 00:45:30.200
[ Laughing ] I can see them down there
Just as easily as you can.

668
00:45:30.400 --> 00:45:32.600
Get to know him and see.

669
00:45:44.900 --> 00:45:47.300
- [ Clears Throat ]
- What's wrong?

670
00:45:47.500 --> 00:45:49.900
Nothing.

671
00:45:50.100 --> 00:45:53.800
- Kovu--
- It's just that my whole life
I've been trained to--

672
00:45:54.100 --> 00:45:55.900
[ Sighs ]
Nothing.

673
00:45:56.100 --> 00:45:58.900
- I gotta go.
- Kovu, wait.

674
00:46:05.500 --> 00:46:07.500
[ Rafiki ]
And where are you going?

675
00:46:07.700 --> 00:46:10.100
N-Nowhere.

676
00:46:10.300 --> 00:46:12.800
Ha! That's what you think!
[ Laughs ]

677
00:46:14.300 --> 00:46:17.600
- Who was that?
- Uh, friend of the family.

678
00:46:17.800 --> 00:46:20.400
{y:i}Mm. Mm- hmm.
{y:i}Mm- hmm. Mm- hmm. Come on!

679
00:46:20.600 --> 00:46:25.000
You follow old Rafiki.
He knows the way. [ Snickering ]

680
00:46:25.300 --> 00:46:29.500
- The way to where?
- [ Laughing ] You follow! You'll see!

681
00:46:30.800 --> 00:46:33.500
Hurry now!

682
00:46:33.600 --> 00:46:36.700
[ Laughing ]
Kovu, come on!

683
00:46:37.000 --> 00:46:39.100
[ Laughing ]

684
00:46:39.300 --> 00:46:42.300
Where's he taking us?

685
00:46:42.500 --> 00:46:47.600
{y:i}A place in your heart
{y:i}called Upendi.

686
00:46:48.000 --> 00:46:49.800
{y:i} * *[African Instrument]

687
00:46:53.200 --> 00:46:55.000
{y:i}[Laughing]

688
00:46:58.900 --> 00:47:00.800
* There's a place
where the crazy moon *

689
00:47:00.800 --> 00:47:03.400
{y:i} * Makes the monkeys sing
{y:i}and the baboons woon *

690
00:47:03.700 --> 00:47:06.000
* And the sultry scent
of the lotus bloom *

691
00:47:06.200 --> 00:47:08.800
{y:i}- * Will carry you away *
- [ Sneezing ]

692
00:47:09.000 --> 00:47:11.300
* While the hippos swing
from the jungle vines *

693
00:47:11.500 --> 00:47:14.200
* And the rhino rumba
in a conga line *

694
00:47:14.400 --> 00:47:16.700
{y:i} *All the pink flamingoes
{y:i}are intertwined *

695
00:47:16.900 --> 00:47:19.100
{y:i} *As the stars come out to play
{y:i}Uhh *

696
00:47:19.300 --> 00:47:24.200
{y:i} * In Upendi where
{y:i}the passion fruit grows sweet *

697
00:47:24.500 --> 00:47:27.500
* And it's so divine
that you lose your mind *

698
00:47:27.700 --> 00:47:31.000
* As it sweeps you
off your feet *

699
00:47:31.200 --> 00:47:35.400
* I n Upendi
without a worry or a care *

700
00:47:35.600 --> 00:47:38.300
* it just takes two
to make it true *

701
00:47:38.400 --> 00:47:40.800
- * Your heart will lead you there *
{y:i}- [Kiara Laughing]

702
00:47:41.000 --> 00:47:43.300
- Where is it?
{y:i}- * In Upendi *

703
00:47:43.500 --> 00:47:45.500
- No place you don't take with you.
{y:i}- * In Upendi *

704
00:47:45.700 --> 00:47:47.500
[ Laughing ]

705
00:47:47.700 --> 00:47:50.000
* Better watch your step
'cause the path is steep *

706
00:47:50.200 --> 00:47:52.600
{y:i} * Better hold your breath
{y:i}'cause the water's deep *

707
00:47:52.800 --> 00:47:55.600
