922
01:03:16.900 --> 01:03:18.900
{y:i} * They'd know *

923
01:03:19.100 --> 01:03:22.400
{y:i} * Love will find a way *

924
01:03:22.600 --> 01:03:27.500
{y:i} *Anywhere we go we're home *

925
01:03:27.800 --> 01:03:31.800
{y:i} * If we are there together *

926
01:03:32.100 --> 01:03:37.700
{y:i} * Like dark turning into day *

927
01:03:38.000 --> 01:03:41.500
{y:i} *Somehow we'll come through *

928
01:03:41.700 --> 01:03:45.400
{y:i} * Now that I've found you *

929
01:03:45.600 --> 01:03:49.300
{y:i} * Love will find a way *

